<title>TRINIDAD AND TOBAGO: CRICKET-INDIA 77-1 V WEST INDIES (296) AT TEA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-INDIA 77-1 V WEST INDIES (296) AT TEA.</headline>
<dateline>PORT OF SPAIN, Trinidad 1997-03-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>India were 77</p>
<p>for one in reply to West Indies' first innings score of 296, at</p>
<p>tea on the second day of the second test at Queen's Park Oval on</p>
<p>Saturday.</p>
</text>
